Hi Guy,

This is very weird. I don't have a great explanation, the error seems to be referencing code within mclapply, the R package for multicore computing, which is normally pretty robust

for example googling "selectChildren(ac[!fin], -1)" finds the following code
https://github.com/wch/r-source/blob/trunk/src/library/parallel/R/unix/mclapply.R

If this keeps happening, can you please post again? I hope it was just a fluke event.

Best,
Robbie

